#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:5 cb7e1cb5dd2d48a2898b72d9b66cce45
msgid "Controlling Input Throw, Trim and Reversal"
msgstr "控制输入行程、微调与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:7 0cba5897fb444c4fa636434382c4b5d7
msgid ""
"Where the parameters starting with ``SERVOn_`` control the servo outputs, "
"the parameters starting with ``RCn_`` control the input side, related to "
"pilot stick movement."
msgstr "以 ``SERVOn_`` 开头的参数控制舵机输出，而以 ``RCn_`` 开头的参数控制输入端，与飞手摇杆动作相关。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:11 b4b69c02c41342daa90d642c4d75564f
msgid ""
"For the 3.8 firmware and above the input side and the output side are "
"completely separated, allowing you to have completely different PWM ranges, "
"reversal and trim on your transmitter input as compared to the servo output."
msgstr "对于 3.8 及更高版本固件，输入端和输出端完全分离，允许遥控器输入与舵机输出具有完全不同的 PWM 范围、反向和微调。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:16 e140ac084c4b4e7dbd6e4d7f9b7124f7
msgid ""
"In addition to the ``RCn_`` parameters for RC input range, trim and "
"reversal, you also can choose the function of the first 4 input channels "
"using the ``RCMAP_`` parameters. The defaults are:"
msgstr ""
"除了用于 RC 输入范围、微调和反向的 ``RCn_`` 参数外，还可以使用 ``RCMAP_`` 参数选择前 4 个输入通道的功能。默认值为："

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:30 6ce19c99b6854900a9124eb49b9ba333
msgid ""
"that means your first input channel will be roll input, the 2nd input "
"channel will be pitch input, the 3rd input channel will be throttle input "
"and the 4th input channel will be yaw input (which maps to rudder control in"
" most flight modes)."
msgstr ""
"即第一个输入通道为横滚输入，第二个输入通道为俯仰输入，第三个输入通道为油门输入，第四个输入通道为偏航输入（在大多数飞行模式下对应方向舵控制）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:35 77b971af72ad41ed89395de8d8fe3b3b
msgid ""
"The input range, trim and reversal are controlled by the RCn_MIN, RCn_MAX, "
"RCn_TRIM and RCn_REVERSED parameters."
msgstr "输入范围、微调和反向由 RCn_MIN、RCn_MAX、RCn_TRIM 和 RCn_REVERSED 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:38 286f123a5216452fac827c915958c27b
msgid "For example, if you have:"
msgstr "例如，若您有："

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:51 49d701c8f5de47c086c882311e115201
msgid ""
"then channel 1 input will be roll (mapping to aileron), with a minimum PWM "
"of 1100, a maximum of 1900 and a trim of 1500. The "
":ref:`RC1_REVERSED<RC1_REVERSED>` value of zero means it is not reversed."
msgstr ""
"则通道 1 输入为横滚（映射到副翼），最小 PWM 为 1100，最大为 1900，微调为 "
"1500。:ref:`RC1_REVERSED<RC1_REVERSED>` 值为零表示未反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:55 1d2852787e9a4ccc8f88b5f06cadcc80
msgid ""
"The process of doing :ref:`Radio Control Calibration <common-radio-control-"
"calibration>` actually will set the TRIM,MIN,and MAX values of each RC input"
" channel to match your Transmitter's output, so these values rarely need to "
"be manually adjusted."
msgstr ""
"执行 :ref:`无线电遥控校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>` 的过程实际上会将每个 RC 输入通道的 "
"TRIM、MIN 和 MAX 值设置为匹配遥控器的输出，因此这些值很少需要手动调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:58 6adfc52250494763904da7d97506c487
msgid "Meaning of Reversed"
msgstr "反向的含义"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:60 472c8a498f704c02b6dca7c4d608f84d
msgid ""
"For RC inputs, the following table shows the standard meanings of the "
"REVERSED parameter for each input type."
msgstr "对于 RC 输入，下表显示了每种输入类型的 REVERSED 参数的标准含义。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:90 b80b39cf5ac34be19895a544973bccba
msgid "Throttle Reversal"
msgstr "油门反向"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:92 daa5fe77c9564fda85af31ac2e36a3fa
msgid ""
"It is very unusual to have a reversed throttle input. In most cases it means"
" your transmitter is setup incorrectly. Having a reversed throttle output is"
" much more common for internal combustion motors. In firmware version 3.8 "
"and later you do not need to reverse throttle input just because your output"
" is reversed (ie. you can set :ref:`RC3_REVERSED<RC3_REVERSED>` separately "
"from :ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED<SERVO3_REVERSED>` )."
msgstr ""
"反向油门输入非常罕见。大多数情况下，这意味着遥控器设置不正确。反向油门输出对于内燃机电机更为常见。在 3.8 "
"及更高版本固件中，无需仅因为输出反向而反向油门输入（即可以分别设置 :ref:`RC3_REVERSED<RC3_REVERSED>` 和 "
":ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED<SERVO3_REVERSED>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rc-throw-trim.rst:99 8a64a68bbf45487ab194d45a9858c9e9
msgid ""
"If you do need to use a reversed throttle input then you need to be be very "
"careful with your throttle failsafe settings. The plane parameter "
":ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` is normally the throttle value below which"
" the autopilot will consider your transmitter to be in RC failsafe. If you "
"have a reversed throttle input then that value will need to be a high value,"
" and will be the value above which you are in RC failsafe."
msgstr ""
"若确实需要使用反向油门输入，则需要非常注意油门失控保护设置。飞机参数 :ref:`THR_FS_VALUE<THR_FS_VALUE>` "
"通常是油门低于此值时飞控认为遥控器处于 RC 失控保护状态的阈值。若使用反向油门输入，则该值需要是一个较高的值，且 RC 失控保护将在高于此值时触发。"
